      "name": "LeavePauseCriticalSection",
      "signature": "BOOL LeavePauseCriticalSection(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Releases the pause critical section for thread synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pcsPause critical section pointer\n2. Assert if pointer is NULL (should never happen after init)\n3. Call LeaveCriticalSection on g_pcsPause\n4. Return TRUE\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nBOOL - Always returns TRUE (1) on success\n\nError Handling:\nCalls FogAssert if g_pcsPause is NULL (line 289 in gdiCore.cpp)\n\nRelated Functions:\nEnterPauseCriticalSection - Acquires this critical section\n\nNotes:\nUsed to synchronize pause state access across threads in D2Gdi module.\nMust be paired with EnterPauseCriticalSection calls.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
