      "name": "ConvertIndexedToRgb24",
      "signature": "undefined4 ConvertIndexedToRgb24(undefined1 * param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Converts an 8-bit indexed color image to 24-bit RGB format.\n\nReads indexed pixel data from a global source buffer and writes RGB triplets\nto the destination buffer using a 256-entry color palette lookup table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return early with success (1) if image height is zero or negative\n2. For each row (0 to height-1):\n   a. For each column (0 to width-1):\n      - Read palette index byte from source\n      - Multiply index by 4 to get RGBQUAD offset\n      - Write R component from palette offset (g_wPad_6f89c46e)\n      - Write G component from palette offset+1 (g_bData_6f89c46d)\n      - Write B component from palette offset+2 (g_bData_6f89c46c)\n   b. Advance source pointer by width\n   c. Advance destination pointer by width*3\n3. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n  pbDestBuffer (ECX) - Pointer to destination buffer for 24-bit RGB output.\n                       Must be at least (width * height * 3) bytes.\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Always returns 1 (success).\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  DWORD_6f89c468 - Image height in pixels\n  DWORD_6f89c05c - Image width in pixels\n  DWORD_6f89c86c - Pointer to source indexed pixel buffer\n  g_wPad_6f89c46e - Palette lookup for R component (word array)\n  g_bData_6f89c46d - Palette lookup for G component\n  g_bData_6f89c46c - Palette lookup for B component (RGBQUAD array base)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:d9d798ee0f3d569474dc138a28985d43fb86a555a75c2f5e3819ad4afc5c81bd",
