      "name": "CreateCourierFont",
      "signature": "undefined CreateCourierFont(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Creates and stores the Courier font for GDI text rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CreateFontA with 10-point height, 400 weight (normal), \"Courier\" face name\n2. Store resulting HFONT handle in global g_hCourierFont\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Font handle stored in g_hCourierFont global\n\nCreateFontA Arguments:\n  nHeight: 10 (0x0A) - Font height in logical units\n  nWidth: 0 - Default width based on height\n  nEscapement: 0 - No rotation of text line\n  nOrientation: 0 - No rotation of individual characters\n  fnWeight: 400 (0x190) - FW_NORMAL weight\n  fdwItalic: 0 - Not italic\n  fdwUnderline: 0 - Not underlined\n  fdwStrikeOut: 0 - No strikeout\n  fdwCharSet: 0 - ANSI_CHARSET\n  fdwOutputPrecision: 0 - OUT_DEFAULT_PRECIS\n  fdwClipPrecision: 0 - CLIP_DEFAULT_PRECIS\n  fdwQuality: 0 - DEFAULT_QUALITY\n  fdwPitchAndFamily: 1 - FIXED_PITCH\n  lpszFace: \"Courier\" - Font face name\n\nRelated Globals:\n  g_hCourierFont (0x6f89c878) - HFONT handle, freed by DeleteCourierFontInternal\n\nCalled By:\n  0x6f8910fe - GDI initialization routine",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
