      "name": "DeleteCourierFontInternal",
      "signature": "void DeleteCourierFontInternal(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Deletes the internal Courier font GDI object.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global font handle g_hCourierFont\n2. Call DeleteObject to release the GDI font resource\n\nParameters:\nNone - This function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nCalled By:\nDeleteCourierFont - Parent cleanup routine\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_hCourierFont is NULL or invalid, DeleteObject handles gracefully\n- Must be called during module cleanup to prevent GDI resource leaks\n\nRelated Globals:\ng_hCourierFont (0x6f89c878) - HFONT handle to the Courier font",
