      "comment": "Draws a rectangle outline using four line segments.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate rect coordinates (assert left <= right, top <= bottom)\n2. Extract corner points from rect structure\n3. Draw top edge: (left,top) to (right,top)\n4. Draw right edge: (right,top) to (right,bottom)\n5. Draw bottom edge: (right,bottom) to (left,bottom)\n6. Draw left edge: (left,bottom) to (left,top)\n\nParameters:\npRect (ECX) - Pointer to RECT structure (left, top, right, bottom as ints)\nbColor (DL) - Palette index/color byte for the outline\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Asserts if left > right or top > bottom\n- Delegates actual line drawing to DrawLineToBuffer\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DrawLineToBuffer: Draws individual line segments\n- ClipRectAndFillWithColor: Fills solid rectangles\n- SubdivideRectQuadrants: Subdivides rectangles\n\nNOTE: Function body appears incomplete in analysis. Manual verification required.",
